{"sessions": "2", "seconds": 240.0, "legs": {"call04_agent": {"name": "call04_agent", "ended_by": "audio_done", "error": null, "session_id": "sess_0o5ukeyrh9ah04mj", "segments": [{"n": 1, "speech_t": 1.22, "commit_t": 6.4, "item_id": "item_yv6laa4pj8972zjo", "transcript": "您好，这里是 Orbix 客服热线，请问有什么可以帮您？", "language": "zh", "latency_ms": 284.1, "deltas": 0, "failed": null}, {"n": 2, "speech_t": 9.7, "commit_t": 12.2, "item_id": "item_51cbsb08okmg58ki", "transcript": "请问您的手机号码是多少？", "language": "zh", "latency_ms": 218.9, "deltas": 0, "failed": null}, {"n": 3, "speech_t": 21.8, "commit_t": 24.3, "item_id": "item_fjabfjn83bsnu6tl", "transcript": "请问是机主本人在使用吗？", "language": "zh", "latency_ms": 242.4, "deltas": 0, "failed": null}, {"n": 4, "speech_t": 37.84, "commit_t": 41.8, "item_id": "item_gd4cdkk6lgr39anh", "transcript": "补卡本身收取少量工本费，邮寄是免费的。", "language": "zh", "latency_ms": 261.4, "deltas": 0, "failed": null}, {"n": 5, "speech_t": 45.62, "commit_t": 49.8, "item_id": "item_bcmf0u1o411angj7", "transcript": "好的，请您告诉我收货地址和联系电话。", "language": "zh", "latency_ms": 241.0, "deltas": 0, "failed": null}, {"n": 6, "speech_t": 53.46, "commit_t": 60.5, "item_id": "item_ze0vlxt669892eul", "transcript": "新卡的初始 PIN 码在卡片的背面，您收到以后可以在手机设置里修改。", "language": "zh", "latency_ms": 320.0, "deltas": 0, "failed": null}, {"n": 7, "speech_t": 64.14, "commit_t": 72.3, "item_id": "item_ew5gtbxxefnl5p78", "transcript": "可以去任何一家营业厅，带上身份证就行。也可以在 App 里申请邮寄，三天内送到。", "language": "zh", "latency_ms": 335.1, "deltas": 0, "failed": null}, {"n": 8, "speech_t": 75.12, "commit_t": 81.0, "item_id": "item_1ydc8czz0jsq55ef", "transcript": "已经停机了，请问您需要补办新的 SIM 卡，还是直接开通 eSIM？", "language": "zh", "latency_ms": 317.6, "deltas": 0, "failed": null}, {"n": 9, "speech_t": 83.82, "commit_t": 90.6, "item_id": "item_61uhg8r0ajmo868c", "transcript": "您别着急，为了安全，我先帮您临时停机，这样别人就不能使用您的号码了。", "language": "zh", "latency_ms": 310.9, "deltas": 0, "failed": null}, {"n": 10, "speech_t": 101.6, "commit_t": 104.7, "item_id": "item_3gigtz1gpd19d4s8", "transcript": "好的，有任何问题随时联系我们。", "language": "zh", "latency_ms": 222.7, "deltas": 0, "failed": null}, {"n": 11, "speech_t": 110.92, "commit_t": 118.7, "item_id": "item_tspmrk05791dcqdr", "transcript": "这种户型建议使用 Mesh 路由器组网，在卧室再放一个节点，信号就能覆盖全屋。", "language": "zh", "latency_ms": 352.2, "deltas": 0, "failed": null}, {"n": 12, "speech_t": 121.36, "commit_t": 122.5, "item_id": "item_5gvbskba3ctatyyy", "transcript": "不复杂。", "language": "zh", "latency_ms": 162.2, "deltas": 0, "failed": null}, {"n": 13, "speech_t": 122.6, "commit_t": 127.2, "item_id": "item_rd1qygljyd198xqg", "transcript": "插上电，用 App 扫码，大约五分钟就可以完成。", "language": "zh", "latency_ms": 261.8, "deltas": 0, "failed": null}, {"n": 14, "speech_t": 127.38, "commit_t": 131.1, "item_id": "item_c5glku4dqc8ztp39", "transcript": "如果您需要，我们也可以安排工程师上门安装。", "language": "zh", "latency_ms": 247.4, "deltas": 0, "failed": null}, {"n": 15, "speech_t": 134.5, "commit_t": 141.9, "item_id": "item_5422hs12wntooowo", "transcript": "我们有三支装和四支装的套装，具体价格您可以在 App 的商城里面查看，现在有活动。", "language": "zh", "latency_ms": 359.9, "deltas": 0, "failed": null}, {"n": 16, "speech_t": 144.08, "commit_t": 150.2, "item_id": "item_ccxne2fzbmh7po2g", "transcript": "购买套装包含一次免费上门安装，单独预约的话需要收取少量的服务费。", "language": "zh", "latency_ms": 296.6, "deltas": 0, "failed": null}, {"n": 17, "speech_t": 155.08, "commit_t": 161.3, "item_id": "item_d4qxxtavi0gdsttl", "transcript": "最好使用同一品牌的设备，这样可以统一管理，切换房间的时候也不会断网。", "language": "zh", "latency_ms": 298.8, "deltas": 0, "failed": null}, {"n": 18, "speech_t": 172.64, "commit_t": 179.7, "item_id": "item_t8eb62zpvvcrr4po", "transcript": "系统显示是三个月前通过 App 开通的，当时有一个免费体验，到期以后自动续费了。", "language": "zh", "latency_ms": 337.4, "deltas": 0, "failed": null}, {"n": 19, "speech_t": 184.18, "commit_t": 186.3, "item_id": "item_wdsu0r6mfymk872c", "transcript": "好的，我帮您查一下。", "language": "zh", "latency_ms": 224.5, "deltas": 0, "failed": null}, {"n": 20, "speech_t": 186.36, "commit_t": 188.2, "item_id": "item_av4rbczo0huhz7pa", "transcript": "请问是哪一天扣的？", "language": "zh", "latency_ms": 186.7, "deltas": 0, "failed": null}, {"n": 21, "speech_t": 191.2, "commit_t": 194.7, "item_id": "item_7fo7pyly40xd2j7j", "transcript": "不客气，请问还有什么可以帮您的吗？", "language": "zh", "latency_ms": 250.1, "deltas": 0, "failed": null}, {"n": 22, "speech_t": 196.4, "commit_t": 203.5, "item_id": "item_eurr8md5wym1coiy", "transcript": "因为您没有使用过这个会员，我可以帮您申请退还这一个月的费用，同时关闭自动续费。", "language": "zh", "latency_ms": 331.7, "deltas": 0, "failed": null}, {"n": 23, "speech_t": 205.98, "commit_t": 212.0, "item_id": "item_pwcmlfvxsoaabwnb", "transcript": "已经关闭了，退款会在五个工作日内原路退回到您的话费账户。", "language": "zh", "latency_ms": 302.8, "deltas": 0, "failed": null}, {"n": 24, "speech_t": 212.58, "commit_t": 215.4, "item_id": "item_xxp3qwjbbw5k0qmu", "transcript": "请问还有其他需要帮助的吗？", "language": "zh", "latency_ms": 223.8, "deltas": 0, "failed": null}, {"n": 25, "speech_t": 219.84, "commit_t": 223.1, "item_id": "item_ocg6kmvvmpxq63oa", "transcript": "感谢您的来电，祝您生活愉快，再见。", "language": "zh", "latency_ms": 251.7, "deltas": 0, "failed": null}]}, "call04_customer": {"name": "call04_customer", "ended_by": "audio_done", "error": null, "session_id": "sess_qk0addc2stwquj3l", "segments": [{"n": 1, "speech_t": 6.98, "commit_t": 8.8, "item_id": "item_ytlewp9gkm4a0oa5", "transcript": "喂，你好。", "language": "zh", "latency_ms": 186.7, "deltas": 0, "failed": null}, {"n": 2, "speech_t": 12.9, "commit_t": 16.7, "item_id": "item_4fu1z6r2flvbh32i", "transcript": "我的号码是一一三零。", "language": "zh", "latency_ms": 214.7, "deltas": 0, "failed": null}, {"n": 3, "speech_t": 16.84, "commit_t": 21.3, "item_id": "item_x1w3s7kj66ac3rv8", "transcript": "零七六六八零一。", "language": "zh", "latency_ms": 223.6, "deltas": 0, "failed": null}, {"n": 4, "speech_t": 24.98, "commit_t": 27.3, "item_id": "item_67pd9lt8odonq1tz", "transcript": "对，是我本人。", "language": "zh", "latency_ms": 202.5, "deltas": 0, "failed": null}, {"n": 5, "speech_t": 27.6, "commit_t": 34.4, "item_id": "item_dipwgqz8h2hx7v2j", "transcript": "喂，我彩普卡的 PIN 码输错了三次，现在被锁住了，怎么办？", "language": "zh", "latency_ms": 317.1, "deltas": 0, "failed": null}, {"n": 6, "speech_t": 34.98, "commit_t": 37.0, "item_id": "item_xarln1velolgo7ud", "transcript": "邮寄要收费吗？", "language": "zh", "latency_ms": 192.5, "deltas": 0, "failed": null}, {"n": 7, "speech_t": 42.92, "commit_t": 44.9, "item_id": "item_8zppzaadu5eptzxz", "transcript": "好的，那我选邮寄吧。", "language": "zh", "latency_ms": 221.1, "deltas": 0, "failed": null}, {"n": 8, "speech_t": 50.48, "commit_t": 52.7, "item_id": "item_qzrl0pbqkiymc85f", "transcript": "新卡的 PIN 码是多少？", "language": "zh", "latency_ms": 221.8, "deltas": 0, "failed": null}, {"n": 9, "speech_t": 61.12, "commit_t": 63.8, "item_id": "item_fip2ry71rrql5da5", "transcript": "不办实体卡要去营业厅吗？", "language": "zh", "latency_ms": 226.4, "deltas": 0, "failed": null}, {"n": 10, "speech_t": 73.5, "commit_t": 76.0, "item_id": "item_13h3u3jxjrp6dxyj", "transcript": "好的，麻烦你帮我停一下。", "language": "zh", "latency_ms": 223.8, "deltas": 0, "failed": null}, {"n": 11, "speech_t": 81.88, "commit_t": 84.5, "item_id": "item_rn9xe986ahyc5gef", "transcript": "手机是昨天晚上丢的。", "language": "zh", "latency_ms": 211.3, "deltas": 0, "failed": null}, {"n": 12, "speech_t": 91.06, "commit_t": 97.1, "item_id": "item_qk1x77nbywgifmly", "transcript": "你好，我换了 Wi-Fi 7 以后，信号反而变差了，这是怎么回事？", "language": "zh", "latency_ms": 308.0, "deltas": 0, "failed": null}, {"n": 13, "speech_t": 97.94, "commit_t": 100.2, "item_id": "item_n373fvnqs55tipqj", "transcript": "好，我先看看商城吧。", "language": "zh", "latency_ms": 215.3, "deltas": 0, "failed": null}, {"n": 14, "speech_t": 105.9, "commit_t": 109.6, "item_id": "item_32f9tyyyoemcvzy8", "transcript": "我家是三室一厅，路由器放在客厅。", "language": "zh", "latency_ms": 219.3, "deltas": 0, "failed": null}, {"n": 15, "speech_t": 119.38, "commit_t": 122.1, "item_id": "item_cpyxquk8ah5cce9x", "transcript": "安装复杂吗？", "language": "zh", "latency_ms": 197.6, "deltas": 0, "failed": null}, {"n": 16, "speech_t": 132.3, "commit_t": 135.2, "item_id": "item_4emqgpaaj6yhiaaz", "transcript": "Mesh 路，油漆要多少钱？", "language": "zh", "latency_ms": 235.4, "deltas": 0, "failed": null}, {"n": 17, "speech_t": 142.72, "commit_t": 144.9, "item_id": "item_4xh1q6sofqv3przk", "transcript": "上门安装收费吗？", "language": "zh", "latency_ms": 191.4, "deltas": 0, "failed": null}, {"n": 18, "speech_t": 151.02, "commit_t": 152.5, "item_id": "item_rbsbmlftxiku7vmt", "transcript": "可以。", "language": "zh", "latency_ms": 172.4, "deltas": 0, "failed": null}, {"n": 19, "speech_t": 153.44, "commit_t": 156.3, "item_id": "item_o7l4rwau0s4t8unv", "transcript": "能和我现在的路由器一起用吗？", "language": "zh", "latency_ms": 233.9, "deltas": 0, "failed": null}, {"n": 20, "speech_t": 162.44, "commit_t": 166.7, "item_id": "item_3qk0e57l9y50qxbz", "transcript": "你好，Orbix，这个月的扣费怎么回事？", "language": "zh", "latency_ms": 249.9, "deltas": 0, "failed": null}, {"n": 21, "speech_t": 166.78, "commit_t": 168.9, "item_id": "item_5tuv9wxjexx6nub4", "transcript": "我想核对一下账单。", "language": "zh", "latency_ms": 220.2, "deltas": 0, "failed": null}, {"n": 22, "speech_t": 169.82, "commit_t": 171.8, "item_id": "item_p50yflrdh7fisiv2", "transcript": "我没有开通过啊。", "language": "zh", "latency_ms": 192.2, "deltas": 0, "failed": null}, {"n": 23, "speech_t": 180.62, "commit_t": 183.7, "item_id": "item_va6e4fs9ok8wxwfh", "transcript": "多出来的是一笔增值业务的费用。", "language": "zh", "latency_ms": 226.5, "deltas": 0, "failed": null}, {"n": 24, "speech_t": 188.9, "commit_t": 190.7, "item_id": "item_kq2sjsl3xx5uicas", "transcript": "明白了，谢谢。", "language": "zh", "latency_ms": 201.0, "deltas": 0, "failed": null}, {"n": 25, "speech_t": 195.66, "commit_t": 197.2, "item_id": "item_36do9g1wmijl1fqr", "transcript": "那这个能退吗？", "language": "zh", "latency_ms": 205.9, "deltas": 0, "failed": null}, {"n": 26, "speech_t": 204.58, "commit_t": 207.0, "item_id": "item_zvqbvhknjr8nvd12", "transcript": "好的，麻烦你帮我关掉。", "language": "zh", "latency_ms": 224.9, "deltas": 0, "failed": null}, {"n": 27, "speech_t": 216.16, "commit_t": 219.2, "item_id": "item_mv6ehipg0s6p02c8", "transcript": "没有了，谢谢你。", "language": "zh", "latency_ms": 202.0, "deltas": 0, "failed": null}, {"n": 28, "speech_t": 223.44, "commit_t": 225.0, "item_id": "item_wnqtdli7s18ultpj", "transcript": "好的，再见。", "language": "zh", "latency_ms": 191.7, "deltas": 0, "failed": null}]}, "call07_agent": {"name": "call07_agent", "ended_by": "audio_done", "error": null, "session_id": "sess_q3ffqg5640in7xgt", "segments": [{"n": 1, "speech_t": 1.42, "commit_t": 6.3, "item_id": "item_pncyamakynx3ixhw", "transcript": "您好，Zentra，我是客服专员，请问您需要办理什么业务？", "language": "zh", "latency_ms": 288.6, "deltas": 0, "failed": null}, {"n": 2, "speech_t": 9.96, "commit_t": 12.9, "item_id": "item_fre528had5phk72t", "transcript": "请问是机主本人在使用吗？", "language": "zh", "latency_ms": 238.4, "deltas": 0, "failed": null}, {"n": 3, "speech_t": 17.16, "commit_t": 21.4, "item_id": "item_0b6crl9wqeeiyu9d", "transcript": "为了保障您的账户安全，需要核实一下您的身份。", "language": "zh", "latency_ms": 249.7, "deltas": 0, "failed": null}, {"n": 4, "speech_t": 21.44, "commit_t": 23.9, "item_id": "item_6i3kff710ffxurap", "transcript": "请问，您的姓氏是？", "language": "zh", "latency_ms": 207.1, "deltas": 0, "failed": null}, {"n": 5, "speech_t": 38.84, "commit_t": 44.6, "item_id": "item_fcxqujva69pl2az8", "transcript": "可以的，您可以在 App 里选择号码转 eSIM，不需要去营业厅。", "language": "zh", "latency_ms": 262.6, "deltas": 0, "failed": null}, {"n": 6, "speech_t": 51.24, "commit_t": 60.0, "item_id": "item_e1gn7dl3bvltotvp", "transcript": "在 App 的 EICM 界面点击生成二维码，有效期是半小时，过期需要重新生成。", "language": "zh", "latency_ms": 319.0, "deltas": 0, "failed": null}, {"n": 7, "speech_t": 68.3, "commit_t": 70.7, "item_id": "item_b11o147xs8xgspqb", "transcript": "这个型号是支持的。", "language": "zh", "latency_ms": 222.1, "deltas": 0, "failed": null}, {"n": 8, "speech_t": 70.96, "commit_t": 77.6, "item_id": "item_s792wrlioe6z4hm8", "transcript": "我先帮您把二维码重新发送到您的邮箱，您可以直接在手机上打开。", "language": "zh", "latency_ms": 306.6, "deltas": 0, "failed": null}, {"n": 9, "speech_t": 78.4, "commit_t": 80.4, "item_id": "item_pvw579ivtdqcr8zn", "transcript": "嗯嗯。", "language": "zh", "latency_ms": 190.2, "deltas": 0, "failed": null}, {"n": 10, "speech_t": 85.02, "commit_t": 86.8, "item_id": "item_4hi7c7uhrlx04dmv", "transcript": "好的，不着急。", "language": "zh", "latency_ms": 200.9, "deltas": 0, "failed": null}, {"n": 11, "speech_t": 86.84, "commit_t": 93.1, "item_id": "item_tuqfeeglgs96609t", "transcript": "如果升级以后还是不行，您把手机型号告诉我，我帮您核对是否支持。", "language": "zh", "latency_ms": 304.2, "deltas": 0, "failed": null}, {"n": 12, "speech_t": 97.34, "commit_t": 105.5, "item_id": "item_spzlvee3fti7lhtf", "transcript": "您需要准备身份证，并保证手机连着 WiFi，因为开通过程中会下载一个二维码配置。", "language": "zh", "latency_ms": 324.0, "deltas": 0, "failed": null}, {"n": 13, "speech_t": 111.72, "commit_t": 116.0, "item_id": "item_jj57wfcyzohvm4ds", "transcript": "请您检查一下手机系统是不是最新版本。", "language": "zh", "latency_ms": 205.7, "deltas": 0, "failed": null}, {"n": 14, "speech_t": 116.38, "commit_t": 121.1, "item_id": "item_muc5z7bkk0uf9pkg", "transcript": "有的机型需要先做一次 OTA 升级才能识别。", "language": "zh", "latency_ms": 266.1, "deltas": 0, "failed": null}, {"n": 15, "speech_t": 126.52, "commit_t": 128.1, "item_id": "item_74x05jr105rea10i", "transcript": "太好了。", "language": "zh", "latency_ms": 147.6, "deltas": 0, "failed": null}, {"n": 16, "speech_t": 128.1, "commit_t": 131.6, "item_id": "item_6fbug556zfwq1vs2", "transcript": "激活以后，实体卡会自动停用。", "language": "zh", "latency_ms": 228.5, "deltas": 0, "failed": null}, {"n": 17, "speech_t": 131.6, "commit_t": 134.9, "item_id": "item_z6n5ka2m22yqv7cn", "transcript": "请您确认手机信号是不是正常。", "language": "zh", "latency_ms": 222.4, "deltas": 0, "failed": null}, {"n": 18, "speech_t": 149.54, "commit_t": 154.9, "item_id": "item_dynruuun3wupvwy7", "transcript": "您原来的合约不受影响，新套餐从下个月一号开始生效。", "language": "zh", "latency_ms": 274.8, "deltas": 0, "failed": null}, {"n": 19, "speech_t": 154.9, "commit_t": 157.6, "item_id": "item_evl02kv2ywxd28aj", "transcript": "当月仍按原套餐计费。", "language": "zh", "latency_ms": 225.5, "deltas": 0, "failed": null}, {"n": 20, "speech_t": 161.68, "commit_t": 164.0, "item_id": "item_qfcyg6nl4nzkits2", "transcript": "收到了，办理成功。", "language": "zh", "latency_ms": 182.1, "deltas": 0, "failed": null}, {"n": 21, "speech_t": 164.02, "commit_t": 168.8, "item_id": "item_zl57q05fxltzl4d1", "transcript": "新套餐下个月一号生效，您可以在 App 里查看详情。", "language": "zh", "latency_ms": 240.2, "deltas": 0, "failed": null}, {"n": 22, "speech_t": 169.72, "commit_t": 172.5, "item_id": "item_jasf6otrkt38emey", "transcript": "我给您介绍一下这几个套餐的区别。", "language": "zh", "latency_ms": 217.5, "deltas": 0, "failed": null}, {"n": 23, "speech_t": 173.2, "commit_t": 177.6, "item_id": "item_byqh5guszb3wqvum", "transcript": "五 G 畅享 199，包含充足的国内流量。", "language": "zh", "latency_ms": 281.9, "deltas": 0, "failed": null}, {"n": 24, "speech_t": 177.8, "commit_t": 182.7, "item_id": "item_ni3jj00qjoh287j2", "transcript": "通话时长足够日常使用，并且赠送一个视频会员。", "language": "zh", "latency_ms": 249.3, "deltas": 0, "failed": null}, {"n": 25, "speech_t": 183.36, "commit_t": 187.9, "item_id": "item_wl4v7jysdqkkpi9h", "transcript": "5G 尊享 299，则包含更多的流量。", "language": "zh", "latency_ms": 261.2, "deltas": 0, "failed": null}, {"n": 26, "speech_t": 187.9, "commit_t": 192.8, "item_id": "item_2ybxg95n76rtnaf6", "transcript": "还可以和家人共享，最多可以添加三位家庭成员。", "language": "zh", "latency_ms": 256.5, "deltas": 0, "failed": null}, {"n": 27, "speech_t": 193.38, "commit_t": 199.8, "item_id": "item_xpren82yd1cgjikt", "transcript": "这些套餐都支持 e3m，您可以不用换卡，在手机里直接开通。", "language": "zh", "latency_ms": 298.2, "deltas": 0, "failed": null}, {"n": 28, "speech_t": 200.48, "commit_t": 207.8, "item_id": "item_flsak7bwt72pl2wx", "transcript": "超出套餐流量以后，网速不会断，但是会降低。您也可以随时购买加油包。", "language": "zh", "latency_ms": 318.8, "deltas": 0, "failed": null}, {"n": 29, "speech_t": 208.34, "commit_t": 211.0, "item_id": "item_dz0r5ktf3wzclmhy", "transcript": "套餐的变更需要您本人办理。", "language": "zh", "latency_ms": 188.2, "deltas": 0, "failed": null}, {"n": 30, "speech_t": 211.04, "commit_t": 214.2, "item_id": "item_5unmzn8f47j3cx8b", "transcript": "办理成功后，会收到短信通知。", "language": "zh", "latency_ms": 217.7, "deltas": 0, "failed": null}, {"n": 31, "speech_t": 216.46, "commit_t": 221.6, "item_id": "item_38c1cxqzihwhhmtl", "transcript": "套餐名字里的数字就是月费，包含充足的通话和流量。", "language": "zh", "latency_ms": 272.0, "deltas": 0, "failed": null}, {"n": 32, "speech_t": 224.06, "commit_t": 228.8, "item_id": "item_qs2picpl539fbzi5", "transcript": "网速是一样的，区别主要在流量和附加权益。", "language": "zh", "latency_ms": 264.3, "deltas": 0, "failed": null}, {"n": 33, "speech_t": 229.08, "commit_t": 233.4, "item_id": "item_2nsor6ru33g54jic", "transcript": "尊享套餐可以免费使用 Orbix 的云盘空间。", "language": "zh", "latency_ms": 260.2, "deltas": 0, "failed": null}]}, "call07_customer": {"name": "call07_customer", "ended_by": "audio_done", "error": null, "session_id": "sess_l2ap7483yh47qh6j", "segments": [{"n": 1, "speech_t": 7.06, "commit_t": 8.9, "item_id": "item_lme3zi98nct24hxk", "transcript": "喂，你好。", "language": "zh", "latency_ms": 186.8, "deltas": 0, "failed": null}, {"n": 2, "speech_t": 14.24, "commit_t": 16.6, "item_id": "item_ftzpwlym4xa3rgf7", "transcript": "对，是我本人。", "language": "zh", "latency_ms": 212.0, "deltas": 0, "failed": null}, {"n": 3, "speech_t": 24.38, "commit_t": 27.8, "item_id": "item_i99nz4md0dcxcz2j", "transcript": "我姓王，哈哈哈哈哈。", "language": "zh", "latency_ms": 213.1, "deltas": 0, "failed": null}, {"n": 4, "speech_t": 28.62, "commit_t": 32.6, "item_id": "item_xukuxad7a8enjcvt", "transcript": "喂，我想把现在的号码转到 eSIM 上，可以吗？", "language": "zh", "latency_ms": 276.5, "deltas": 0, "failed": null}, {"n": 5, "speech_t": 33.46, "commit_t": 37.0, "item_id": "item_kw0iown4me5i7bsw", "transcript": "我现在用的是实体 SIM 吗？", "language": "zh", "latency_ms": 199.6, "deltas": 0, "failed": null}, {"n": 6, "speech_t": 37.24, "commit_t": 38.2, "item_id": "item_w3f4hn75nyjwol74", "transcript": "卡。", "language": "zh", "latency_ms": 166.6, "deltas": 0, "failed": null}, {"n": 7, "speech_t": 45.96, "commit_t": 48.1, "item_id": "item_6mmrg6gx26oy0paa", "transcript": "自由的。", "language": "zh", "latency_ms": 155.2, "deltas": 0, "failed": null}, {"n": 8, "speech_t": 48.72, "commit_t": 50.5, "item_id": "item_d471beyc47d2qjuc", "transcript": "二维码在哪里看？", "language": "zh", "latency_ms": 198.1, "deltas": 0, "failed": null}, {"n": 9, "speech_t": 60.62, "commit_t": 61.6, "item_id": "item_65v15q5vbq8dn0ao", "transcript": "停。", "language": "zh", "latency_ms": 171.3, "deltas": 0, "failed": null}, {"n": 10, "speech_t": 62.22, "commit_t": 67.2, "item_id": "item_fkv16zj5jan45d35", "transcript": "手机型号是五G畅享一百九十九配套的那款。", "language": "zh", "latency_ms": 275.0, "deltas": 0, "failed": null}, {"n": 11, "speech_t": 80.8, "commit_t": 83.6, "item_id": "item_r7z9vgtgfyd2rwuc", "transcript": "我现在去升级，等一下再打给你们。", "language": "zh", "latency_ms": 247.7, "deltas": 0, "failed": null}, {"n": 12, "speech_t": 93.68, "commit_t": 94.6, "item_id": "item_8fnebhimugyep6wp", "transcript": "行。", "language": "zh", "latency_ms": 192.6, "deltas": 0, "failed": null}, {"n": 13, "speech_t": 95.38, "commit_t": 98.0, "item_id": "item_lf49yh35pt5iee61", "transcript": "需要准备什么吗？", "language": "zh", "latency_ms": 164.1, "deltas": 0, "failed": null}, {"n": 14, "speech_t": 106.44, "commit_t": 110.6, "item_id": "item_6g4ur6kesoagkp6q", "transcript": "我扫了，但是手机提示无法添加。", "language": "zh", "latency_ms": 233.7, "deltas": 0, "failed": null}, {"n": 15, "speech_t": 121.64, "commit_t": 123.1, "item_id": "item_0l2pjlv73s92sjd9", "transcript": "哦，明白了。", "language": "zh", "latency_ms": 187.0, "deltas": 0, "failed": null}, {"n": 16, "speech_t": 124.28, "commit_t": 127.4, "item_id": "item_wv3p1pqelx72tb3z", "transcript": "收到了，好像可以啦。", "language": "zh", "latency_ms": 214.7, "deltas": 0, "failed": null}, {"n": 17, "speech_t": 136.16, "commit_t": 137.1, "item_id": "item_m2gtmkbbd6eadskc", "transcript": "请。", "language": "zh", "latency_ms": 191.0, "deltas": 0, "failed": null}, {"n": 18, "speech_t": 137.9, "commit_t": 144.8, "item_id": "item_mjk03gljubfeqrng", "transcript": "喂，我现在用的是五G畅享一百九十九，感觉流量不太够用，能换个大一点的吗？", "language": "zh", "latency_ms": 350.1, "deltas": 0, "failed": null}, {"n": 19, "speech_t": 145.76, "commit_t": 149.0, "item_id": "item_vomdbogmnw8fmjp9", "transcript": "换了套餐以后，原来的合约怎么办？", "language": "zh", "latency_ms": 188.4, "deltas": 0, "failed": null}, {"n": 20, "speech_t": 158.2, "commit_t": 162.6, "item_id": "item_ri3b1w725qn3ck0h", "transcript": "短信收到了，我回复了。", "language": "zh", "latency_ms": 225.7, "deltas": 0, "failed": null}, {"n": 21, "speech_t": 215.16, "commit_t": 217.2, "item_id": "item_j8epg1c6wciy2o2p", "transcript": "那个套餐每个月多少钱？", "language": "zh", "latency_ms": 190.0, "deltas": 0, "failed": null}, {"n": 22, "speech_t": 222.9, "commit_t": 225.1, "item_id": "item_ffxm1v6usal86jlk", "transcript": "这些套餐的网速有区别吗？", "language": "zh", "latency_ms": 238.2, "deltas": 0, "failed": null}, {"n": 23, "speech_t": 234.08, "commit_t": 237.7, "item_id": "item_qfsz5hdmnr0k9kcy", "transcript": "好，那就换成五G畅享 199 吧。", "language": "zh", "latency_ms": 275.3, "deltas": 0, "failed": null}]}}, "bot_rows": null}